WEBVTT

00:21:28.396 --> 00:21:30.436
I'm dedicated, I'm driven.

00:21:30.460 --> 00:21:35.056
But I do so in a very intentional,
meaningful way.

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:39.321
SWM: She has always been a very
compassionate and empathetic person,

00:21:39.345 --> 00:21:42.216
but I saw a significant shift

00:21:42.240 --> 00:21:45.566
in leading with that first.

00:21:45.590 --> 00:21:48.446
Not just driving to get things done

00:21:48.470 --> 00:21:50.569
but ensuring that along the way

00:21:50.593 --> 00:21:52.596
she's taking care of herself,

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:56.756
but everybody around her is as well.

00:21:56.780 --> 00:21:59.506
AG: Joanne is not only
living a more balanced life.

00:21:59.530 --> 00:22:02.616
She's also encouraging
her team members to do the same.